# src/exchange.ts cite D1/D2 in their header comments, and D1 carries the
# anchor-collision proof the whole navigation model rests on),
# test/hygiene.test.ts and test/fixtures/ (real tests and real test data),
# and CLAUDE.md (the codebase rules, minus the process links).
